id: SCA-040
title: Custom pip.conf with non-PyPI index
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: pip.conf pip.ini
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: index-url\s*=\s*https?://
    message: pip.conf has custom index-url — verify this is a trusted registry. Non-PyPI indexes can serve trojaned packages.
fix: Document and audit custom pip indexes. Use a repository proxy (Artifactory, Nexus) that mirrors PyPI with vulnerability scanning.
